1
00:00:05,030 --> 00:00:11,450
This migration check uses input traj exampleTraj dot lammpstrj.

2
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:25,290
The 1.0.1 global for hydrogen bonds is getHbondNetwork, and seams hbonds prints nop 250 hbonds 460.

3
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:36,030
Coordination is new in 2.x. The earlier version had no global for it, and calcCN first shipped in yodaStruct 2.4.1.

4
00:00:36,030 --> 00:00:45,130
seams cn for the 1-2 pair at cutoff 4.5 prints cn 9.1.

5
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:48,810
docs migrate requires both lines.

6
00:00:48,810 --> 00:00:53,830
Fingerprint, pairs and domains are all new to 2.x.

7
00:00:53,830 --> 00:00:59,050
v1.0 had no global for any of them.

8
00:00:59,050 --> 00:01:08,750
topologyFingerprint first shipped in yodaStruct 2.8.0, and contactPairs and domainStats in 2.7.0.

9
00:01:08,750 --> 00:01:12,150
seams fingerprint prints classes 89.

10
00:01:12,150 --> 00:01:15,930
seams pairs prints count zero.

11
00:01:15,930 --> 00:01:21,250
seams domains on the polar subset prints largest 750.

12
00:01:21,250 --> 00:01:27,050
docs migrate requires classes 89, count zero, and largest 750.

